  <item>
    <title>Mud!</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/mud</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;There&#039;s not much I dislike when touring more than MUD! We got caught in a thunderstorm while riding (illicitly) on dirt roads in Antero Reservoir State Park, and we were just completely stopped by the mud. Nancy went down in a slippery section. I had to stop because the BOB trailer&#039;s wheel wouldn&#039;t go around any more. Mark had to clean everything out. It was bad. But we got enough mud off to continue riding, and eventually got to the end of the day!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
