  <item>
    <title>Mark Shimoda</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/mark_shimoda</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Mark Shimoda joined us for the ride from Denver to Gunnison and has been a complete delight. It was his first-ever bike-packing bike-camping, even though he&#039;s toured extensively. Mark rode strong and wonderfully and was a great travelling companion... And is eagerly planning more touring!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
