  <item>
    <title>Nancy, Mark, and Linda go home :-(</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/nancy_mark_and_linda_go_home</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Well, we made it to Gunnison and had a wonderful weekend of riding, but Nancy, Mark Shimoda and his wife Linda all just packed up in the car Linda drove over on Friday, and they&#039;re all headed back to real life. Now I start a new adventure, heading for the Northwest!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
